{"displayStem":"12시간마다 투여하는 약물 X를 복용하는 환자에서 농도가 낮게 보고되었다. 해당 약물의 추적 기준은 정상상태의 다음 투여 직전 농도이다. 투약 기록과 신기능을 확인하였다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"자료는 독립적으로 작성한 교육용 모의자료이다."}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence \"><div class=\"evidence\"><div class=\"measurement-panels\"><figure class=\"measurement-panel\"><figcaption>투여 후 채혈 시각과 농도</figcaption><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 580 355\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"투여 후 채혈 시각과 농도。직전 투여 후 시간 (h)、약물농도 (mg/L)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"580\" height=\"355\" fill=\"white\"></rect><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"526\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"20\" y=\"25\">약물농도 (mg/L)</text><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"76\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><line x1=\"186\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"186\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"186\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6</text><line x1=\"296\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"296\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"296\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">12</text><line x1=\"406\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"406\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"406\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">18</text><line x1=\"516\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"516\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"516\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">24</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"234\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"185.5\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"185.5\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"190.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">7.5</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"142\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"142\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"147\" text-anchor=\"end\">15</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"98.5\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"98.5\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"103.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">22.5</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"55\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"end\">30</text><circle cx=\"94.33333333333333\" cy=\"94.44\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"149.33333333333331\" cy=\"119.96\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"222.66666666666666\" cy=\"143.74\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"296\" cy=\"160.56\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"85\" cy=\"301\" r=\"3\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><text x=\"97\" y=\"306\">계획대로 투약한 날</text><rect x=\"421.1333333333333\" y=\"184.62\" width=\"6.4\" height=\"6.4\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"327\" y=\"298\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><text x=\"342\" y=\"306\">최근 채혈</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\">직전 투여 후 시간 (h)</text></svg></figure></div></div></div>","<div class=\"dataset-evidence \"><div class=\"evidence\"><table><thead><tr><th>항목</th><th>최근 기록</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>직전 복용</td><td>전날 20시</td></tr><tr><td>예정된 다음 복용</td><td>당일 08시, 누락</td></tr><tr><td>채혈 시각</td><td>당일 15시</td></tr><tr><td>최근 신기능·병용약</td><td>큰 변화 없음</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>"]}